        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Copperplate engraving, printed in mauve on tabby-woven cotton ground. Two vignettes repeated on a shaded ground strewn with leafy sprigs: one shows a youth rowing, labelled \"DEPART DU Pr NAVIGATEUR\", other showing a girl standing before an elderly woman, labelled \"MELIDE ET SA MÈRE.\" Faded; a few light brown stains. All edges cut."@en ;
